<SceneText>
  <Speakers>
    <Section>Speaker</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45812,46004,46244,46716,46856,47040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45912,46132,46360,46488</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46560,46948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ほぇあ～～、まったく、まったく。
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;は、気立てのええ娘っ子だ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hooohh... I swear, &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'s the best-
natured little lady you ever did see.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45916</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>へん、おまえは&lt;Mel&gt;の
一面しか見てねーんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph. Well, you've only
seen her *good* side.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46008</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだぁ？　おめぇ、嫉妬してるだか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What? You're not gettin'
jealous, now, are ya?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46136</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あいつは、オレがせっかくうまく作った
カレーに意地悪でマシュマロ入れたり……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once, she was in a bad mood, so she took the delicious
curry I'd worked hard on, and spiked it with marshmallows.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46248</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うそ、こけぇ！
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;が、そっだらことするわけねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yer lyin'! &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'d never
do somethin' like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46364</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>寝てる間にオレの顔に落書きしたり、
庭にこっそり落とし穴掘ったり</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She drew all over my face while I was
asleep, and dug a pit trap in our yard.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46492</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>家の壁に、こっそり『&lt;Mel&gt;参上』とか書いたり、
隠れたところで悪行三昧だぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She even wrote "MEL WAS HERE" all over our
house! She's as evil as they come, deep down!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46564</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ウソ言わないでよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, stop lying!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はん！　やーっぱり、あのチビ助のウソだったか。
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;がそんな意地悪しないって、わかってただよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ha! So it was all lies? I knew it! &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'s not
got so much as a single bad bone in her body!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>unfinished</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46860</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>大体、カレーにマシュマロ入れるなんて、
ウソをつくにも、程度が低過ぎるっつー話だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And besides, stickin' marshmallows in a curry?
Even for lyin', that's stoopin' a mite too low!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46952</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だ、だって……
甘い方が好きなんだもん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>B-But... I just like
sweet things, okay!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47044</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_015_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>まっさっか。そったらことが……！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yer not tellin' me...
that one was...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
